{"id":1182,"date":"2026-07-01T12:22:43","date_gmt":"2026-07-01T12:22:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/?p=1182"},"modified":"2026-07-17T08:18:28","modified_gmt":"2026-07-17T08:18:28","slug":"cido-fanet%ef%bc%9a%e9%9d%a2%e5%90%91-5g-%e8%ae%be%e5%a4%87%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%a1%e9%81%93%e9%b2%81%e6%a3%92%e5%b0%84%e9%a2%91%e6%8c%87%e7%ba%b9%e8%af%86%e5%88%ab","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/en\/cido-fanet%ef%bc%9a%e9%9d%a2%e5%90%91-5g-%e8%ae%be%e5%a4%87%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%a1%e9%81%93%e9%b2%81%e6%a3%92%e5%b0%84%e9%a2%91%e6%8c%87%e7%ba%b9%e8%af%86%e5%88%ab\/","title":{"rendered":"CIDO-FANet: Channel-Robust RF Fingerprint Identification for 5G Devices"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3749991f wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"min-height:1000px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-458a08b5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><h2 class=\"lab-paper-title wp-block-post-title\">CIDO-FANet\uff1a\u9762\u5411 5G \u8bbe\u5907\u7684\u4fe1\u9053\u9c81\u68d2\u5c04\u9891\u6307\u7eb9\u8bc6\u522b<\/h2>\n\n\n<p class=\"lab-paper-meta has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Longlong Shen and Guyue Li and Jingyuan Han and Tianqi Wu and Aiqun Hu<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"lab-paper-meta has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><em>2026 IEEE Wireless Communications and Networking Conference Workshops (WCNCW)<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-contrast-3-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-contrast-3-background-color has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-46005010 lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udccc Abstract (\u6458\u8981)<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote has-text-align-left lab-abstract-quote has-small-font-size\" style=\"margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10);padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><blockquote><p>\u5c04\u9891\u6307\u7eb9\u8bc6\u522b\uff08RFFI\uff09\u80fd\u591f\u589e\u5f3a\u65e0\u7ebf\u5b89\u5168\u6027\uff0c\u4f46\u9488\u5bf9 5G \u65b0\u7a7a\u53e3\uff08NR\uff09\u7684\u7814\u7a76\u8f83\u4e3a\u7a00\u7f3a\uff0c\u4e14\u6027\u80fd\u5e38\u5728\u4fe1\u9053\u53d8\u5316\u4e0b\u9000\u5316\u3002\u672c\u6587\u63d0\u51fa\u4e00\u79cd\u9762\u5411 5G NR \u7684\u4fe1\u9053\u9c81\u68d2 RFFI \u6846\u67b6\u3002\u9996\u5148\uff0c\u5f15\u5165\u4fe1\u9053\u65e0\u5173\u5dee\u5206\u7b97\u5b50\uff08Channel-Independent Differential Operator, CIDO\uff09\uff0c\u4ece NR \u89e3\u8c03\u53c2\u8003\u4fe1\u53f7\uff08DMRS\uff09\u4e2d\u5bfc\u51fa\u4fe1\u9053\u4e0d\u53d8\u7684\u8bbe\u5907\u7279\u5f81\uff0c\u5728\u6291\u5236\u4fe1\u9053\u5931\u771f\u7684\u540c\u65f6\u4fdd\u7559\u8bbe\u5907\u7279\u6027\u3002\u5176\u6b21\uff0c\u4e3a\u9002\u914d NR \u7075\u6d3b\u7684\u8d44\u6e90\u6620\u5c04\u5e76\u5229\u7528\u9891\u57df\u76f8\u5173\u6027\uff0c\u8bbe\u8ba1\u4e86\u9891\u57df\u81ea\u76f8\u5173\u7f51\u7edc\uff08Frequency-domain Autocorrelation Network, FANet\uff09\uff0c\u5b83\u53ef\u5904\u7406\u53d8\u957f\u9891\u57df\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u5e76\u91c7\u7528\u9891\u57df\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\u4ee5\u63d0\u5347\u533a\u5206\u80fd\u529b\u3002\u6700\u540e\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u5728\u591a\u6837\u73af\u5883\u4e0e\u65f6\u95f4\u4e0b\u91c7\u96c6\u7684\u4e94\u53f0\u5546\u7528 5G NR \u8bbe\u5907\u6570\u636e\u8fdb\u884c\u9a8c\u8bc1\uff0c\u6240\u63d0\u65b9\u6cd5\u6301\u7eed\u83b7\u5f97\u9ad8\u51c6\u786e\u7387\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u8de8\u4fe1\u9053\u6cdb\u5316\u65b9\u9762\u663e\u8457\u4f18\u4e8e\u5404\u57fa\u7ebf\u3002\u8fd9\u4e9b\u7ed3\u679c\u8868\u660e\uff0c\u5728\u52a8\u6001 NR \u573a\u666f\u4e0b\u5b9e\u73b0\u53ef\u9760\u7684\u57fa\u4e8e\u5c04\u9891\u6307\u7eb9\u7684\u8bbe\u5907\u8bc6\u522b\u662f\u4e00\u6761\u5207\u5b9e\u53ef\u884c\u7684\u8def\u5f84\u3002<\/p><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-6adec98e lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udca1 Key Contributions (\u6838\u5fc3\u8d21\u732e)<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px\" class=\"wp-block-list lab-feature-list\">\n<li class=\"lab-feature-list\"><strong>\u63d0\u51fa\u4fe1\u9053\u6291\u5236\u7684\u5c04\u9891\u6307\u7eb9\u8868\u793a CIDO<\/strong>\uff1a\u5728\u65e0\u9700\u663e\u5f0f\u4fe1\u9053\u5747\u8861\u7684\u60c5\u51b5\u4e0b\u4fdd\u7559\u5177\u533a\u5206\u6027\u7684 RFF \u7ebf\u7d22\uff0c\u5177\u6709\u4f4e\u590d\u6742\u5ea6\u4e0e\u5f3a\u9c81\u68d2\u6027\u3002<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"lab-feature-list\"><strong>\u63d0\u51fa FANet<\/strong>\uff1a\u5c06\u63a9\u7801\u9891\u57df\u81ea\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\u4e0e\u957f\u5ea6\u4e0d\u53d8\uff08length-invariant\uff09\u6c60\u5316\u76f8\u7ed3\u5408\uff0c\u4ee5\u6355\u83b7\u9891\u57df\u76f8\u5173\u6027\uff0c\u5e76\u5929\u7136\u652f\u6301\u53d8\u957f\u7684 5G NR \u8f93\u5165\u3002<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"lab-feature-list\"><strong>\u91c7\u96c6\u5546\u7528 gNB \u4e0e\u5546\u7528 5G NR \u8bbe\u5907\u6570\u636e<\/strong>\uff1a\u5728\u591a\u6837\u65e0\u7ebf\u73af\u5883\u4e0b\u91c7\u96c6\uff0c\u5927\u91cf\u5b9e\u9a8c\u8868\u660e\u6240\u63d0\u65b9\u6cd5\u53ef\u5728\u590d\u6742\u4fe1\u9053\u4e0b\u5b9e\u73b0\u53ef\u9760\u7684\u8bbe\u5907\u8bc6\u522b\uff0c\u4ece\u800c\u6709\u6548\u652f\u6491\u5b9e\u9645\u7684\u8eab\u4efd\u8ba4\u8bc1\u3002<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-2f9d57f4 lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udd27 Method Overview\uff08\u65b9\u6cd5\u6982\u89c8\uff09<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group lab-paper-results is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-b46d2053 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-1024x498.png ,https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05.png 780w, https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-1024x498.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"uag-image-1184\" width=\"802\" height=\"656\" title=\"1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-831b2db5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"lab-experiment-caption has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>\u4fe1\u53f7\u5904\u7406\u4e0e\u5f52\u4e00\u5316<\/strong>\uff1a\u63a5\u6536\u57fa\u5e26\u4fe1\u53f7\u5efa\u6a21\u4e3a $y(t)=h(\\tau,t)*f(x(t))+n(t)$\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d $f(\\cdot)$ \u805a\u5408\u53d1\u5c04\u673a\u786c\u4ef6\u635f\u4f24\u3002\u7ecf\u540c\u6b65\u3001CFO \u8865\u507f\u3001\u53bb CP \u4e0e FFT \u540e\u5f97\u5230 $Y[k,l]=H[k,l]U[k,l]+N[k,l]$\uff08\u5f0f (2)\uff09\u3002\u5728\u6309 3GPP TS 38.211 \u786e\u5b9a\u7684 DMRS \u8d44\u6e90\u5355\u5143\u4e0a\uff0c\u7528\u5df2\u77e5\u7406\u60f3 DMRS \u9010 RE \u5f52\u4e00\u5316\uff0c\u5f97\u5230 $CSI(k,l)=H[k,l]F_{TX}(k,l)+\\tilde{N}[k,l]$\uff08\u5f0f (3)\uff09\uff0c\u4ecd\u542b\u4fe1\u9053\u9879 $H[k,l]$\u3002<strong>CIDO\uff08\u4fe1\u9053\u65e0\u5173\u5dee\u5206\u7b97\u5b50\uff09<\/strong>\uff1a\u5bf9\u540c\u4e00\u65f6\u9699\u5185\u76f8\u90bb DMRS \u7b26\u53f7\u5bf9\u4f5c\u5546\u4ee5\u62b5\u6d88\u4fe1\u9053\u7740\u8272\uff0c$CIDO_p(k)=\\frac{CSI(k,l_{p+1})}{CSI(k,l_p)}$\uff08\u5f0f (4)\uff0c\u96f6\u5206\u6bcd\u65f6\u53d6\u54e8\u5175\u503c $c_{\\max}$\uff09\u3002\u5f53\u7b26\u53f7\u65f6\u95f4\u63a5\u8fd1\u65f6 $H[k,l_{p+1}]\\approx\\gamma_p H[k,l_p]$\uff08\u5f0f (6)\uff09\uff0c\u4f7f\u4fe1\u9053\u5f62\u72b6\u5728\u5546\u4e2d\u57fa\u672c\u62b5\u6d88\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559\u53d1\u5c04\u673a\u76f8\u5173\u7279\u6027\uff1b\u5404\u5546\u5411\u91cf\u6309\u5bf9\u5e8f\u62fc\u63a5\u4e3a\u6700\u7ec8\u7279\u5f81\uff08\u5f0f (7)\uff09\u3002<strong>FANet\uff08\u9891\u57df\u81ea\u76f8\u5173\u7f51\u7edc\uff09<\/strong>\uff1a\u5c06\u590d\u503c CIDO \u89e3\u8026\u4e3a\u5e45\u5ea6\u4e0e\u76f8\u4f4d\u5e8f\u5217\uff08\u5f0f (8)(9)\uff09\uff0c\u4ee5\u6539\u4e3a\u4e00\u7ef4\u7684 ResNet-18 \u4e3a\u9aa8\u5e72\uff1b\u5bf9\u5e45\u5ea6\u6d41\u91c7\u7528\u7a97\u53e3\u5316\u5c40\u90e8\u81ea\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\uff08\u5f0f (10)\uff0c\u590d\u6742\u5ea6\u7531 $O(K^2)$ \u964d\u81f3 $O(K(2r+1))$\uff09\uff0c\u5bf9\u76f8\u4f4d\u6d41\u91c7\u7528\u8f7b\u91cf 1D \u7a33\u5b9a\u5668\uff1b\u518d\u901a\u8fc7\u63a9\u7801\u5168\u5c40\u5e73\u5747\u6c60\u5316\uff08\u5f0f (11)\uff09\u8f93\u51fa\u4e0e\u4fdd\u7559\u5b50\u8f7d\u6ce2\u6570 $K$ \u65e0\u5173\u7684\u56fa\u5b9a\u7ef4\u8868\u793a\u3002<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-43443d20 lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udcca Experimental Results (\u5b9e\u9a8c\u7ed3\u679c)<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group lab-paper-results is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-e2339269 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ab937bfb-d3ec-4fb1-bb61-d60c2014af83-1024x732.png ,https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ab937bfb-d3ec-4fb1-bb61-d60c2014af83.png 780w, https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ab937bfb-d3ec-4fb1-bb61-d60c2014af83.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ab937bfb-d3ec-4fb1-bb61-d60c2014af83-1024x732.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"uag-image-1185\" width=\"802\" height=\"656\" title=\"ab937bfb-d3ec-4fb1-bb61-d60c2014af83\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-831b2db5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"lab-experiment-caption has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>CIDO\u2013FANet \u5728\u5168\u90e8\u516d\u4e2a\u6d4b\u8bd5\u57df\u4e0a\u5747\u53d6\u5f97\u6700\u9ad8\u51c6\u786e\u7387\uff0c\u5e76\u663e\u8457\u4f18\u4e8e\u5404\u57fa\u7ebf\u65b9\u6cd5<\/strong>\uff1a\u5982 Fig. 6 \u6240\u793a\uff0c\u5176\u5728 E1_L1\u3001E1_L2\u3001E1_L3 \u4e0a\u5206\u522b\u8fbe\u5230 98.12%\u300196.25%\u300197.27%\uff0c\u5728 E2_L1\u3001E2_L2\u3001E2_M \u4e0a\u5206\u522b\u8fbe\u5230 94.70%\u300191.71%\u300181.35%\u3002\u5e73\u5747\u800c\u8a00\uff0c\u76f8\u8f83 ChInS \u63d0\u5347\u7ea6 7.7 \u4e2a\u767e\u5206\u70b9\uff08E2_M \u6700\u5927\u63d0\u5347 10.43\uff09\uff0c\u76f8\u8f83 ZF \u5747\u8861\u63d0\u5347\u7ea6 12.8 \u4e2a\u767e\u5206\u70b9\uff08E1_L2 \u6700\u5927\u63d0\u5347 25.19\uff09\uff0c\u76f8\u8f83\u539f\u59cb I\/Q \u57fa\u7ebf\u5728\u6240\u6709\u6d4b\u8bd5\u57df\u5747\u8d85\u8fc7 40 \u4e2a\u767e\u5206\u70b9\uff08E2_M \u573a\u666f\u9ad8\u8fbe 45.51\uff09\u3002\u6b64\u5916\uff0c\u6d88\u878d\u5b9e\u9a8c\uff08Table I\uff09\u663e\u793a\uff0c\u53bb\u9664 FANet \u4ec5\u7528 CIDO \u7279\u5f81\u65f6\u6027\u80fd\u4e0b\u964d\uff0cCIDO\u2013FANet \u76f8\u8f83 CIDO \u57fa\u7ebf\u5e73\u5747\u63d0\u5347\u7ea6 2.6 \u4e2a\u767e\u5206\u70b9\uff0c\u5728\u6700\u5177\u6311\u6218\u7684\u8fd0\u52a8\u57df E2_M \u4ecd\u5e26\u6765 +2.83 \u4e2a\u767e\u5206\u70b9\u63d0\u5347\uff0881.35% vs. 78.52%\uff09\u3002<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-e3c2d50d lab-subheading\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">\ud83d\udcdd Cite This Paper (\u5f15\u7528\u683c\u5f0f)<\/h3><\/div>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code lab-bibtex-code has-small-font-size\"><code>@inproceedings{shen2026cidofanet,\n  author    = {Longlong Shen and Guyue Li and Jingyuan Han and Tianqi Wu and Aiqun Hu},\n  title     = {CIDO-FANet: Channel-Robust RF Fingerprinting Identification for 5G Devices},\n  booktitle = {2026 IEEE Wireless Communications and Networking Conference Workshops (WCNCW)},\n  year      = {2026}\n}<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-788841da wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>RF fingerprinting identification (RFFI) can enhance wireless security, but research targeting 5G New Radio (NR) is scarce, and performance often degrades under channel variations. This paper proposes a channel-robust RFFI framework for 5G NR. First, a Channel-Independent Differential Operator (CIDO) is introduced to derive channel-invariant device features from NR demodulation reference signals (DMRS), suppressing channel distortion while preserving device characteristics. Second, to accommodate NR's flexible resource mapping and exploit frequency-domain correlations, a Frequency-domain Autocorrelation Network (FANet) is designed, which handles variable-length frequency-domain inputs and employs frequency-domain attention to enhance discriminative capability. Finally, validation is conducted using data from five commercial 5G NR devices collected across diverse environments and times; the proposed method consistently achieves high accuracy and significantly outperforms all baselines in cross-channel generalization. These results demonstrate a viable path toward reliable RF fingerprinting-based device identification in dynamic NR scenarios.<\/p>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1184,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"mypost","format":"standard","meta":{"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[5],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1182","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-research"],"uagb_featured_image_src":{"full":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05.png",1307,636,false],"thumbnail":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-150x150.png",150,150,true],"medium":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-300x146.png",300,146,true],"medium_large":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-768x374.png",768,374,true],"large":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05-1024x498.png",1024,498,true],"1536x1536":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/1aa077cf-2874-4e6e-a940-ba69c5275f05.png",1307,636,false],"2048x2048":["https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_l